/* pinn. – App state: defaults and family data variables (js/zustand.js)
   Part of the app code that used to be a single block in index.html. Classic script, no build step:
   it is loaded right after the inline script of index.html and before the other files in js/
   (the load order is listed at the bottom of index.html and in pinn-setup.sh).
   Contents: fixed values and defaults (PALETTE, ROOM_ICONS, WASTE_TYPES, WEEKDAYS, CATEGORIES, NO_RECIPE_MEAL_IMAGE, ALL_MENU_TABS,
   finance, contract and pantry defaults, AVATARS, EXAMPLE_MEMBERS), small lookups (wasteTypeById, cleaningCategoryById,
   kitchenToolById, normalizePantrySettings, isExampleMember), defaultFamilyData and all variables that hold the family data
   after login (members, recipes, shopping, pantry, tasks, settings …). weatherData stays in index.html (the clock uses it
   while loading). The UI state is in js/bedienzustand.js. */

